## Non-Profit Statement of Purpose

This software, documentation, cognitive architecture blueprints, models, and diagnostic engines are developed and distributed solely for **non-profit, scientific, academic, educational, and open research purposes**. 

Under no circumstances may any individual, organization, corporate entity, or collective monetize, package for commercial sale, charge access fees for, or incorporate this software into paid commercial SaaS services, closed-source proprietary distributions, or commercial automated agents without prior written express consent from the copyright holder.

